    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "DJ Blizzard aka BigBlizz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110884668885041345992/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUrc5KFvfmJZnu1cQsCHmi1sMCxDjkAN0SbquvJwueE1mP4p4HK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "*EDIT\nThis location has now been ‘temporarily closed for about a month and I still have 2 of the gift certificates I was given to use by the end of the year. I was told I could use them at any other location but on the certificate itself it says only this one.\n\nShowed up 830pm when they were closed at 9pm. Sign was lit up OPEN and door was unlocked. The lights were off at the front of the store. There were 2 staff members inside and when I pulled the door one looked at the other staff and what looked like said ‘seriously’ I went to close my car door and came back and the staff member begins the counter came to the door and said they were closed.\n\nTerrible customer services ce to have the song on that says open and door unlocked and be in your operating hours but then tell a customer you’re closed because you don’t want to make a sandwich.\n\nI’ll be contacting head office about this as it’s unacceptable to be turning away business during business hours becauseh you don’t want to make a sandwich.\n\nMost likely won’t be coming back to Dagwoods as this was first experience",
        "time": 1734845448,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jia Zheng",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116252619446297720490/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUXOQvQ7MUaaLMfcT2ASLMoRF9xKsPGTvF3hQqbm9m5PQtMLgt9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "This Dagwood sandwich store is the best place to grab a sandwich. The store is very clean and the staff members are so warm and kind. I like to hang out with friends or just grab something quick to eat everytime I visit Montreal. The sandwiches here are better than other franchise stores I’ve been to. You can taste the difference because the ingredients are super fresh. If you love sandwiches you’ve got to check it out. I highly recommend this spot!",
        "time": 1723687932,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Poshalay Leceleco",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106093602422213141499/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLBBKUN6fw6Jy1xuoiAavOSIMPMGtN3VQ50fl7D5o_iR-AVeQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Just ordered a sub and chili. Chili was really cold. Barely got any lettuce in my sub. I PAYED for extra sauce and berely got any. Also paid for a root beer and got a cherry cola. How hard is it to remove it from the app when you don’t have it and how hard is it to make a sub with less than 10 ingredients. Usually my favourite fast food, but repetitive mistakes in my past orders make me want to never order from that location.",
        "time": 1698688111,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mik Scheper",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109586831923533059900/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSRIlGOdYj97LYL7QAmduvmJThsq47CpKJsdUiGFNsibEq815fYQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Not much choice, the music was loud and obnoxious, and I was disgusted to see they use the same machine to slice the cheese as the meat, without cleaning it inbetween. It's nice that they offered to put both sandwiches in the same bag, though—good to see a business trying to reduce waste.",
        "time": 1666024727,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "J H",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102171206481563926682/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIKguE6sJ8DgGya47aonxNXYhTuQpCA48I93lsTRow7ppvNtQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "One of the best subs I’ve ever had! Everything was so fresh and tasty. Staff was so nice to my whole family considering we were completely clueless because of the language barrier. Would definitely recommend!",
        "time": 1530926965,
        "translated": false
      }
